From: zephyrstudiosllc <zschwendi@zephyrstudios.dev>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 21:25:13 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 13/15] feat(kernel): add portable Jak 1 data-arena header
 proof (AI-assisted)

Initialize caller-owned RW storage with the exact Jak 1 heap and fixed-symbol header layout without binding global runtime memory or producing executable code.
---
